@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000
@petId = 00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001
@shelterId = 00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000002
@applicationId = 00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000003
@reportId = 00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000004
@photoId = 00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000005
@vaccinationId = 00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000006
@documentId = 00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000007
@userId = 00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000008
@cookie = paste-pawpal_token-cookie-here

### Health
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/health

### Auth: check email and user ID availability
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/availability?email=alex@example.test
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/availability?userCode=alex_rivera

### Auth: register adopter or shelter role
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{"name":"Alex Rivera","email":"alex@example.test","userCode":"alex_rivera","password":"ExamplePass123","role":"adopter"}

### Auth: login with email or user ID; copy the pawpal_token response cookie
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"identifier":"alex@example.test","password":"ExamplePass123"}

### Auth: restore session
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/me
Cookie: {{cookie}}

### Auth: logout
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/logout
Cookie: {{cookie}}

### Pet discovery: list, search, filter, sort, paginate
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/pets?page=1&pageSize=12&species=dog&status=available&city=Portland&q=gentle&sort=newest

### Pet discovery: profile
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/pets/{{petId}}

### Pet photo bytes or redirect
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/photos/{{photoId}}

### Filter metadata
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/meta/filters

### Smart matching
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/match
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: {{cookie}}

{"activity":"medium","home":"house","kids":"no","otherPets":"none","experience":"some","species":"any","age":"any","size":"any","includePairs":true}

### Smart matching: bonded pairs
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/match/pairs
Content-Type: application/json

{"activity":"medium","home":"house","kids":"no","otherPets":"none","experience":"some","species":"rabbit","age":"any","size":"any","includePairs":true}

### Smart matching: last saved run
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/match/last
Cookie: {{cookie}}

### Saved pets: list
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/me/saved?page=1&pageSize=12
Cookie: {{cookie}}

### Saved pets: save / unsave
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/me/saved/{{petId}}
Cookie: {{cookie}}

###
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/me/saved/{{petId}}
Cookie: {{cookie}}

### Adoption application: submit
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/applications
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: {{cookie}}

{"petId":"{{petId}}","applicantName":"Alex Rivera","applicantEmail":"alex@example.test","contactNo":"555-0100","addressLine":"10 Test Street","city":"Portland","state":"OR","postcode":"97201","homeType":"house_with_yard","ownership":"own","householdAdults":2,"hasChildren":false,"youngestChildAge":null,"otherPets":"","experience":"some","hoursAlonePerDay":4,"reason":"Our home and routine are a good fit for this pet."}

### Adopter application list and detail
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/applications/mine?page=1&pageSize=12
Cookie: {{cookie}}

###
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/applications/{{applicationId}}
Cookie: {{cookie}}

### Shelter application queue and application detail
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/applications/shelter?status=submitted&q=Alex&page=1&pageSize=12
Cookie: {{cookie}}

###
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/applications/{{applicationId}}
Cookie: {{cookie}}

### Start review, update checks, approve, reject, or complete
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/applications/{{applicationId}}/status
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: {{cookie}}

{"to":"under_review"}

###
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/applications/{{applicationId}}/checks
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: {{cookie}}

{"checks":[{"checkType":"identity","result":"passed"},{"checkType":"address","result":"passed"},{"checkType":"household_agreement","result":"passed"},{"checkType":"landlord_permission","result":"not_applicable"},{"checkType":"home_check","result":"passed"}]}

###
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/applications/{{applicationId}}/status
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: {{cookie}}

{"to":"approved"}

###
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/applications/{{applicationId}}/status
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: {{cookie}}

{"to":"completed"}

### Reject with required note
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/applications/{{applicationId}}/status
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: {{cookie}}

{"to":"rejected","note":"The household has chosen another pet."}

### Shelter adoption summary, records, and CSV export
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/shelter/summary
Cookie: {{cookie}}

###
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/shelter/adoption-records?page=1&pageSize=12
Cookie: {{cookie}}

###
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/shelter/adoption-records.csv
Cookie: {{cookie}}

### Register a shelter profile (attach one to three valid PDF/JPG/PNG documents in a REST Client multipart request)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/shelters
Cookie: {{cookie}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----PawPalBoundary

------PawPalBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="name"

Example Animal Rescue
------PawPalBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="description"

A sample shelter profile.
------PawPalBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="addressLine"

10 Rescue Road
------PawPalBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="city"

Portland
------PawPalBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="state"

OR
------PawPalBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="country"

US
------PawPalBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="contactEmail"

contact@example.test
------PawPalBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="documents"; filename="shelter-proof.pdf"
Content-Type: application/pdf

< ./fixtures/shelter-proof.pdf
------PawPalBoundary--

### Shelter profile: read and update own profile
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/shelters/mine
Cookie: {{cookie}}

###
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/shelters/mine
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: {{cookie}}

{"description":"Updated shelter description."}

### Shelter management: pet knowledge and dashboard
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/shelter/pet-knowledge?species=dog
Cookie: {{cookie}}

###
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/shelter/dashboard
Cookie: {{cookie}}

### Shelter pets: list, export and create
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/shelter/pets?page=1&pageSize=12&species=dog&status=available&q=Buddy
Cookie: {{cookie}}

###
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/shelter/pets/export.csv
Cookie: {{cookie}}

###
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/shelter/pets
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: {{cookie}}

{"name":"Buddy","species":"dog","breed":"Mixed breed","ageMonths":18,"gender":"unknown","size":"medium","colors":[],"description":"A friendly companion.","temperament":["gentle"],"energyLevel":"medium","spayedNeutered":true,"microchipped":false,"houseTrained":true,"specialNeeds":false,"goodWithChildren":"unknown","goodWithDogs":"unknown","goodWithCats":"unknown"}

### Shelter pet: detail, update and soft remove
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/shelter/pets/{{petId}}
Cookie: {{cookie}}

###
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/shelter/pets/{{petId}}
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: {{cookie}}

{"description":"Updated pet description."}

###
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/shelter/pets/{{petId}}
Cookie: {{cookie}}

### Upload photos (attach 1–6 image files; memory storage, signature checked, processed as JPEG)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/shelter/pets/{{petId}}/photos
Cookie: {{cookie}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----PawPalBoundary

------PawPalBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="photos"; filename="pet.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ./pet.jpg
------PawPalBoundary--

### Photo primary, ordering, and removal
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/shelter/pets/{{petId}}/photos/{{photoId}}/primary
Cookie: {{cookie}}

###
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/shelter/pets/{{petId}}/photos/order
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: {{cookie}}

{"photoIds":["{{photoId}}"]}

###
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/shelter/pets/{{petId}}/photos/{{photoId}}
Cookie: {{cookie}}

### Vaccinations: list and add
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/shelter/pets/{{petId}}/vaccinations
Cookie: {{cookie}}

###
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/shelter/pets/{{petId}}/vaccinations
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: {{cookie}}

{"vaccineTypeId":1,"givenOn":"2026-06-01","nextDueOn":"2027-06-01","clinic":"Example Vet"}

###
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/shelter/pets/{{petId}}/vaccinations/{{vaccinationId}}
Cookie: {{cookie}}

### Reports: create
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/reports
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: {{cookie}}

{"targetType":"pet","targetId":"{{petId}}","reason":"inaccurate_information","details":"The listing details need review."}

### Admin: authorization ping and stats
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/ping
Cookie: {{cookie}}

###
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/stats
Cookie: {{cookie}}

### Admin users: list, suspend/activate, remove
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/users?q=Alex&role=adopter&status=active&page=1&pageSize=12
Cookie: {{cookie}}

###
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/users/{{userId}}/status
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: {{cookie}}

{"status":"suspend"}

###
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/users/{{userId}}
Cookie: {{cookie}}

### Admin shelters: list, documents, verify or reject
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/shelters?status=pending
Cookie: {{cookie}}

###
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/shelters/{{shelterId}}/documents
Cookie: {{cookie}}

###
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/documents/{{documentId}}
Cookie: {{cookie}}

###
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/shelters/{{shelterId}}/verification
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: {{cookie}}

{"action":"verify"}

### Admin listings and moderation
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/pets?q=Buddy&species=dog&page=1&pageSize=12
Cookie: {{cookie}}

###
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/pets/{{petId}}
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: {{cookie}}

{"reason":"Listing requires moderation."}

### Admin applications, reports, and audit log
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/applications?status=submitted&page=1&pageSize=12
Cookie: {{cookie}}

###
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/reports?status=open
Cookie: {{cookie}}

###
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/reports/{{reportId}}
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: {{cookie}}

{"action":"dismiss","note":"Reviewed and closed."}

###
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/audit
Cookie: {{cookie}}
